WEBVTT

01:00.020 --> 01:01.420
You must find it strange.

01:01.520 --> 01:03.350
Why was I poisoned by you

01:03.570 --> 01:05.230
but still managed to survive?

01:08.280 --> 01:10.280
When you assassinated Zhang Ruipu,

01:10.500 --> 01:13.190
you coated the blade
with Twilight Grass Poison, right?

01:13.190 --> 01:15.330
I should have been killed
in one strike.

01:15.330 --> 01:18.150
Unfortunately, I was exposed
to Twilight Grass three years ago

01:18.150 --> 01:20.350
and had already developed antibodies.

01:20.650 --> 01:23.820
Just like how those inoculated
against smallpox are immune to it.

01:23.820 --> 01:25.150
That's why I didn't die.

01:26.610 --> 01:28.340
But the poison didn't wear off.

01:28.760 --> 01:30.260
It confused my mind

01:30.800 --> 01:32.400
and caused hallucinations.

01:34.090 --> 01:35.090
Actually, I...

01:36.360 --> 01:38.310
have never left this room.

01:53.740 --> 01:54.910
I have a question.

02:01.050 --> 02:02.660
Why are you hunting down people

02:02.660 --> 02:04.460
from the Archives on the Nan'an?

03:48.690 --> 03:55.340
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

03:55.630 --> 03:58.240
[Episode 7]

05:16.950 --> 05:18.570
You're just a cripple.

05:19.540 --> 05:21.070
When did you know

05:21.650 --> 05:23.230
you were poisoned?

05:27.870 --> 05:30.230
The first time I saw Chen Xifeng,

05:31.270 --> 05:32.680
I had my suspicions.

05:33.810 --> 05:35.370
The people from the Panhua Reef Case

05:35.370 --> 05:36.990
appeared on the Nan'an.

05:37.420 --> 05:39.450
They have such a terrible stench.

05:40.240 --> 05:42.700
Ordinary people couldn't possibly miss it.

05:43.200 --> 05:44.930
But they had no reaction at all.

05:45.670 --> 05:47.200
So I confirmed then

05:47.920 --> 05:49.780
that something was wrong with me.

05:54.740 --> 05:56.070
The smell of cured meat?

06:01.170 --> 06:02.610
And later, I realized

06:04.410 --> 06:05.810
someone was watching me,

06:07.890 --> 06:09.600
wanting me to die on the ship.

06:22.500 --> 06:24.190
These are all hallucinations.

06:24.190 --> 06:25.940
Everything I see is not real.

06:26.460 --> 06:28.310
Hailou is not even here.

06:31.750 --> 06:33.659
It has always been just me.

06:51.730 --> 06:52.380
Ten,

06:53.120 --> 06:54.070
eleven,

06:54.400 --> 06:55.320
twelve,

06:55.540 --> 06:56.490
thirteen.

06:57.200 --> 06:59.600
The patrol light flashes every 13 seconds.

07:09.790 --> 07:12.320
You understand this feeling best,
don't you?

07:12.470 --> 07:14.050
I'm just a burden.

07:15.590 --> 07:16.720
You are not a burden.

07:16.810 --> 07:17.940
You are not a burden.

07:18.450 --> 07:21.020
Stop messing around. You'll die here.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.190
Then let me die.

07:24.990 --> 07:27.080
If I become a burden to you,

07:28.430 --> 07:29.730
I'd rather die.

07:32.060 --> 07:33.390
You are my brother.

07:33.500 --> 07:34.690
You must stay alive.

07:34.720 --> 07:35.480
Stay alive!

07:35.480 --> 07:36.500
I can't.

07:36.980 --> 07:38.640
I don't want to live like this.

07:39.680 --> 07:40.540
Help me.

07:41.780 --> 07:43.510
I shouldn't live like this.

07:45.130 --> 07:45.800
Kill me.

07:48.950 --> 07:49.880
Kill me.

07:52.360 --> 07:53.180
Help me.

08:20.220 --> 08:21.930
These are all hallucinations.

08:21.930 --> 08:23.660
Everything I see is unreal.

08:42.960 --> 08:44.039
Zhang Hailou.

08:46.010 --> 08:47.580
You are so lucky.

08:49.830 --> 08:51.310
Lend me some luck.

09:05.700 --> 09:07.240
Why was I poisoned by you

09:07.240 --> 09:08.900
but still managed to survive?

09:11.120 --> 09:11.740
Ten,

09:12.560 --> 09:13.370
eleven,

09:14.200 --> 09:15.030
twelve,

09:16.070 --> 09:17.030
thirteen.

09:19.500 --> 09:21.610
You really are a monster.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.890
You're just like me now,

09:41.380 --> 09:42.240
unable to walk.

09:52.970 --> 09:55.370
Now it's my turn to ask you!

09:58.800 --> 10:01.500
Why are you trying to kill the people
of the Archives?

10:01.500 --> 10:03.460
Who gave the order?

11:06.430 --> 11:07.950
[If the pitcher plant plan succeeds,]

11:07.970 --> 11:10.010
[wipe out every member of the Archives.]

11:16.150 --> 11:18.150
If the pitcher plant plan succeeds,

11:18.580 --> 11:20.620
wipe out every member of the Archives

11:20.620 --> 11:23.020
and proceed immediately to the next phase.

11:23.650 --> 11:25.530
This is 20 years of my life's work.

11:26.360 --> 11:27.820
There must be no mistakes.

11:37.690 --> 11:39.350
The content of this letter...

11:41.460 --> 11:42.200
is true?

11:46.420 --> 11:48.700
This has been going on for 20 years?

11:48.890 --> 11:50.620
Why are you trying to kill the people
of the Archives?

11:50.620 --> 11:52.080
What's your next step?

11:53.810 --> 11:54.710
Spit it out!

12:03.390 --> 12:05.290
You think you're smart.

12:06.890 --> 12:08.660
Actually...

12:08.810 --> 12:11.320
we are all just pawns.

12:11.710 --> 12:12.950
The Nan'an

12:13.670 --> 12:15.930
is like a giant pitcher plant.

12:17.360 --> 12:19.460
You flies from the Archives

12:20.070 --> 12:21.540
cannot escape.

12:25.250 --> 12:27.430
You're no different.

13:45.340 --> 13:47.940
I need to find Zhang Hailou
as soon as possible.

14:05.690 --> 14:06.970
Cheer up, Fast Gun.

14:07.000 --> 14:07.500
Come,

14:08.510 --> 14:09.690
have a drink first.

14:09.860 --> 14:11.170
This drink is on me.

14:13.050 --> 14:13.480
Sit.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.350
How did you manage to do it?

14:26.790 --> 14:27.880
With this.

14:28.510 --> 14:29.340
What is this?

14:29.440 --> 14:30.170
Poison?

14:34.670 --> 14:35.730
It's a kind of herb.

14:35.790 --> 14:37.310
After touching human skin,

14:37.310 --> 14:39.390
it produces symptoms similar

14:39.390 --> 14:40.450
to toxic weed poisoning.

14:40.450 --> 14:41.580
It hurts and itches.

14:41.890 --> 14:43.030
Combined with my

14:43.130 --> 14:44.600
excellent makeup skills,

14:45.130 --> 14:47.250
ordinary people can't tell the difference.

14:47.250 --> 14:49.380
But I have to thank a good friend of mine

14:50.130 --> 14:51.190
who helped me a lot.

14:54.570 --> 14:56.170
[Nanyang Daily]

14:58.000 --> 15:00.890
[Nanyang Daily]

15:05.170 --> 15:06.810
The red rash drawn with this pigment

15:06.810 --> 15:07.920
cannot be wiped off

15:08.150 --> 15:09.410
by ordinary reagents.

15:09.410 --> 15:10.030
It can only be wiped off

15:10.030 --> 15:12.080
with my specially formulated

15:12.080 --> 15:13.080
alcohol reagent.

15:15.100 --> 15:16.180
How is it, Fast Gun?

15:16.600 --> 15:18.290
I know you are very interested

15:18.480 --> 15:19.750
in my next plan.

15:20.370 --> 15:21.250
Feel free to ask.

15:21.250 --> 15:22.940
I can tell you everything now.

15:24.610 --> 15:26.850
I don't care about your bullshit plan.

15:27.100 --> 15:28.290
I just want to go back.

15:28.290 --> 15:33.440
[Countdown: 12 hours]

15:33.060 --> 15:33.970
Actually,

15:34.670 --> 15:36.100
my plan is very simple.

15:36.870 --> 15:38.930
It's to draw the snake out of its hole.

15:41.790 --> 15:42.550
First,

15:42.750 --> 15:44.220
I will randomly

15:44.220 --> 15:45.550
choose some passengers

15:45.870 --> 15:47.630
and use the ink
mixed with the special herb

15:47.630 --> 15:49.430
to draw red rashes on their arms.

15:59.220 --> 16:01.550
But adult Chinese males will be excluded.

16:01.600 --> 16:03.730
Those warlord soldiers at Panhua Reef

16:03.750 --> 16:05.150
are likely the culprits.

16:05.250 --> 16:07.630
They are all adult Chinese males.

16:11.340 --> 16:13.180
Please, doctor!

16:11.570 --> 16:15.250
[Countdown: 4 hours]

16:13.960 --> 16:15.050
Save us!

16:20.370 --> 16:22.480
If the culprits find out
that the toxic weed is spreading

16:22.480 --> 16:23.480
and can be cured,

16:24.050 --> 16:25.100
they will definitely come

16:25.100 --> 16:26.360
to see what's going on.

16:27.510 --> 16:28.510
On the other hand,

16:28.840 --> 16:31.700
those who I drew rashes on
and didn't seek treatment

16:31.790 --> 16:32.720
are also suspicious.

16:32.720 --> 16:34.340
Doctor, save us, doctor!

16:34.340 --> 16:35.720
Why won't you let us in?

16:35.720 --> 16:36.890
Let us in!

16:36.980 --> 16:37.750
Doctor!

16:38.130 --> 16:39.510
Why can they go in?

16:39.600 --> 16:41.010
What I need to do next

16:41.220 --> 16:42.750
is to observe these people—

16:43.050 --> 16:44.150
who came

16:44.220 --> 16:45.550
and who didn't.

16:49.320 --> 16:51.270
O Lord Almighty!

16:51.370 --> 16:54.370
We must face misfortune!

16:54.370 --> 16:57.300
Only the children who believe in God
will be blessed!

16:57.500 --> 17:00.130
O Lord Almighty, please bless us!

17:00.250 --> 17:02.170
Bless us!

17:02.750 --> 17:03.670
Bless us!

17:04.829 --> 17:06.329
Bless us!

17:09.940 --> 17:10.740
They're gone!

17:11.140 --> 17:12.089
I'm cured!

17:12.589 --> 17:13.640
Thank you, thank you!

17:13.640 --> 17:14.329
Thank you!

17:15.220 --> 17:17.589
Look! I'm cured!

17:17.589 --> 17:18.130
Great!

17:18.490 --> 17:19.050
Shh.

17:19.550 --> 17:20.829
What the hell are you doing?

17:20.829 --> 17:21.890
Catching robbers.

17:22.290 --> 17:23.089
How?

17:24.180 --> 17:25.900
Simply put, bluff them

17:25.930 --> 17:26.849
and see their reactions.

17:26.849 --> 17:28.790
It's like throwing a bomb into a cesspool

17:28.790 --> 17:30.070
to see if there are maggots.

17:30.070 --> 17:31.250
What are you talking about?

17:31.250 --> 17:32.380
Are you out of ideas?

17:33.380 --> 17:34.330
Next one.

17:45.970 --> 17:46.720
Next.

17:48.080 --> 17:49.160
Bless us.

17:56.370 --> 17:57.660
Bless us.

17:58.880 --> 17:59.480
Go in now.

17:59.550 --> 18:00.480
I'm cured!

18:00.640 --> 18:02.090
Bless us.

18:05.720 --> 18:07.010
Thank you, thank you!

18:07.030 --> 18:08.230
Thank you, thank you!

18:17.300 --> 18:18.900
Any maggots? Where are they?

18:21.510 --> 18:22.380
Maybe

18:23.090 --> 18:24.430
this cesspool...

18:24.790 --> 18:26.010
is relatively clean.

18:26.940 --> 18:28.670
Yeah, why are there no maggots?

18:29.640 --> 18:31.240
What other plans do you have?

18:39.020 --> 18:42.070
[Countdown: 15 minutes]

18:45.050 --> 18:46.140
We're running out of time!

18:46.140 --> 18:47.590
Look, look!

18:47.610 --> 18:49.250
The Nan'an is about to depart.

18:49.250 --> 18:50.940
And your time is up!

18:54.510 --> 18:55.670
I need to get ready.

18:56.050 --> 18:56.790
Do you mind?

18:57.440 --> 18:57.940
I...

18:57.940 --> 18:58.330
Okay.

19:00.550 --> 19:01.350
See you later.

19:03.940 --> 19:05.000
Don't go anywhere.

19:11.140 --> 19:11.760
[Countdown: 10 minutes]

19:11.410 --> 19:12.690
Mentor, Shrimpie.

19:11.780 --> 19:12.530
[Countdown: 9 minutes]

19:12.550 --> 19:13.210
[Countdown: 8 minutes]

19:12.940 --> 19:13.960
Am I exposed?

19:13.230 --> 19:13.820
[Countdown: 7 minutes]

19:13.990 --> 19:15.170
Impossible.

19:15.940 --> 19:18.400
Why aren't the culprits
interested in this?

19:18.640 --> 19:20.800
Did someone see through my disguise?

19:21.210 --> 19:22.470
That can't be, Mentor.

19:23.180 --> 19:25.040
You know my disguise skills best.

19:25.290 --> 19:27.440
Ordinary people can't tell the difference.

19:27.440 --> 19:28.570
How is that possible?

19:28.570 --> 19:30.970
Then why didn't the culprits
take the bait?

19:32.420 --> 19:33.530
Is there any other way

19:33.530 --> 19:34.960
to lure the culprits out?

19:37.130 --> 19:38.090
Oh yes, baby.

19:38.570 --> 19:39.570
The time has come.

19:44.380 --> 19:45.290
I'm running out of time.

19:44.490 --> 19:45.660
[Countdown: 4 minutes]

19:45.310 --> 19:46.370
Mentor, Shrimpie,

19:46.780 --> 19:47.940
take care of yourselves.

19:47.940 --> 19:49.470
I'll go find a place to hide.

19:50.700 --> 19:51.280
No.

19:52.220 --> 19:53.550
Once the ship sets sail,

19:53.550 --> 19:54.880
I won't be able to return
to the South Seas for months.

19:54.880 --> 19:57.050
[Countdown: 2 minutes]

19:58.770 --> 20:00.400
Should I just get off the ship
and go home now?

20:00.400 --> 20:02.290
Don't play these useless little tricks.

20:02.290 --> 20:03.640
By the time you came here,

20:03.640 --> 20:04.680
they had already left.

20:04.680 --> 20:06.610
And my boss's men are watching you.

20:06.790 --> 20:09.050
We will have eyes and ears around you
all the time.

20:09.050 --> 20:11.330
If you do anything unrelated
to the investigation,

20:11.330 --> 20:12.270
your friends

20:12.720 --> 20:13.750
will die.

20:20.690 --> 20:24.820
[First Class] [Second Class]

20:25.290 --> 20:26.050
Wait.

20:26.380 --> 20:27.790
There are doctors on board.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.520
You can see them for any issues.

20:31.890 --> 20:33.640
With the toxic weed outbreak on the ship,

20:33.640 --> 20:34.830
everyone came to see what was happening.

20:34.830 --> 20:36.690
Why didn't the ship doctors come?

20:36.720 --> 20:38.920
There are symptoms
of Twilight Grass Poison on the ship.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.460
Some passengers who can't see the Dukun

20:40.460 --> 20:42.960
would definitely
go to the ship doctors first.

20:42.960 --> 20:44.450
There's a toxic weed outbreak on board.

20:44.450 --> 20:46.880
The ship doctor should lock down the ship
and not let it sail.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.480
But he had no reaction at all.

20:50.500 --> 20:52.230
The ship doctor is the culprit!

20:58.680 --> 20:59.360
Oh my.

20:59.550 --> 21:01.010
I knew I could count on you.

21:01.500 --> 21:03.030
I'm going to the infirmary.

21:05.430 --> 21:06.750
Your time is up.

21:06.790 --> 21:07.500
I know.

21:07.750 --> 21:09.280
But you're 2 seconds early!

21:09.290 --> 21:10.030
Fast Gun!

21:19.410 --> 21:20.530
Wait, wait!

21:22.360 --> 21:23.340
The robbers have been found!

21:23.340 --> 21:24.030
They are in the infirmary!

21:24.030 --> 21:25.050
They are the ship doctors!

21:25.050 --> 21:25.820
Steven,

21:25.880 --> 21:26.560
you don't want

21:26.560 --> 21:27.920
these 2 days of hard work
to be in vain, do you?

21:27.920 --> 21:29.750
How dare you mention the last 2 days!

21:29.750 --> 21:31.420
There were no robbers at all!

21:33.180 --> 21:34.010
Everyone.

21:34.510 --> 21:35.970
When Steven cries,

21:36.000 --> 21:37.130
he's a...

22:05.440 --> 22:06.090
Shit!

22:29.380 --> 22:31.240
I almost caught the culprits.

22:43.350 --> 22:44.710
[Bowne]

22:45.510 --> 22:46.510
You ugly thing.

22:46.510 --> 22:47.840
Why are you haunting me?

23:10.080 --> 23:16.180
[He Jianxi, accountant]

23:29.770 --> 23:31.070
Who are you?

23:31.880 --> 23:32.700
You...

23:34.730 --> 23:35.560
Stowaway?

23:37.560 --> 23:38.820
I didn't stow away.

23:39.890 --> 23:41.180
I came to use the toilet and take a nap,

23:41.180 --> 23:42.310
but accidentally fell into the sea.

23:42.310 --> 23:43.960
I barely managed to climb back up.

23:43.960 --> 23:45.090
I'm "poop-sleepy".

23:45.440 --> 23:46.770
I get sleepy when I poop.

23:46.770 --> 23:48.160
Stop talking nonsense.

23:49.060 --> 23:50.620
Stowing away is a serious crime.

23:50.620 --> 23:51.550
If you get caught,

23:51.550 --> 23:54.350
I'll be implicated
and thrown into the sea as well.

23:54.780 --> 23:55.930
You're crazy.

23:56.540 --> 23:58.200
How did you manage to climb up?

23:58.760 --> 24:00.360
[Public Toilet]

24:01.570 --> 24:02.630
What are you doing?

24:03.270 --> 24:04.570
[Public Toilet]

24:03.710 --> 24:04.300
Let go!

24:05.560 --> 24:08.010
That's my hard-earned money!

24:12.280 --> 24:13.360
Stowaway...

24:13.570 --> 24:14.330
Stop.

24:19.070 --> 24:20.200
Show me your ticket.

24:23.030 --> 24:24.760
Then I'll just buy a ticket now.

24:31.230 --> 24:32.630
It's an unlicensed ship.

24:36.560 --> 24:38.130
You've been robbing Chinese passengers.

24:38.130 --> 24:40.730
Aren't you afraid the Sea Plague
will find out?

24:41.120 --> 24:43.350
That Plague isn't that well-informed.

24:43.570 --> 24:45.630
Besides, this guy has no companions.

24:46.180 --> 24:47.450
If we throw him into the sea
off the back of the ship,

24:47.450 --> 24:48.510
no one will notice.

24:49.870 --> 24:51.520
Since you saw this,

24:53.230 --> 24:55.240
I guess I'll just take another life.

24:57.840 --> 24:59.090
In that case,

24:59.950 --> 25:01.550
I'll have no choice but to...

25:04.040 --> 25:05.200
Show your ticket.

25:11.850 --> 25:12.850
Spare us.

25:13.470 --> 25:14.160
Sir,

25:14.610 --> 25:15.790
this is my cousin.

25:16.470 --> 25:19.070
We are the only two remaining heirs
of our family.

25:19.070 --> 25:20.340
If you kill us both,

25:20.360 --> 25:21.690
our bloodline will end.

25:26.070 --> 25:26.670
Sir,

25:27.130 --> 25:28.440
we will absolutely not tell anyone

25:28.440 --> 25:29.600
what you did today.

25:29.630 --> 25:31.540
Please spare our worthless lives.

25:31.540 --> 25:32.320
Sir.

25:33.850 --> 25:34.680
You didn't

25:36.200 --> 25:38.080
rob us.

25:38.790 --> 25:40.320
It's my gift to you.

25:41.040 --> 25:41.830
Just take it.

25:41.850 --> 25:42.650
Rest assured.

25:42.720 --> 25:43.480
The Sea Plague

25:43.480 --> 25:45.070
won't know about this either.

25:45.070 --> 25:46.450
Disasters are rampant these days.

25:46.450 --> 25:49.510
You don't want to
bring down divine punishment, do you?

25:49.750 --> 25:50.700
You little brat.

25:52.280 --> 25:54.060
You're too smart.

25:56.160 --> 25:56.870
Alright.

25:58.150 --> 26:01.210
You're not like those
who value money over their lives.

26:01.400 --> 26:03.560
You know how to show respect.

26:05.480 --> 26:06.810
I am the Two-ear Dragon.

26:07.140 --> 26:08.110
Call me Dragon.

26:08.140 --> 26:08.900
Dragon.

26:10.480 --> 26:11.630
On this ship,

26:12.480 --> 26:13.680
I've got you covered.

26:16.420 --> 26:18.410
I'll keep the money for now.

26:18.440 --> 26:20.290
I'll make arrangements for you later.

26:20.290 --> 26:21.200
Okay, okay.

26:22.270 --> 26:22.850
Hurry.

26:23.480 --> 26:25.510
Get them a private room.

26:25.510 --> 26:26.640
-Thank you.
-And...

26:26.900 --> 26:27.900
What's your name?

26:28.440 --> 26:29.200
Salty Zhang.

26:29.760 --> 26:32.020
Hurry up and get a ticket for Salty Zhang.

26:32.470 --> 26:34.600
Without a ticket, I can't protect you.

26:36.300 --> 26:38.540
Cousin, enjoy yourself.

26:52.050 --> 26:53.050
How pathetic.

26:53.800 --> 26:55.550
These people barely escaped death.

26:55.550 --> 26:56.880
If they act tough again,

26:57.700 --> 26:59.710
their lives will be over.

27:01.430 --> 27:03.060
Why did you give him my stuff?

27:03.670 --> 27:05.460
That's my hard-earned money!

27:05.490 --> 27:06.810
We shouldn't give in to people like that!

27:06.810 --> 27:08.140
You have quite a temper.

27:10.270 --> 27:13.140
[Nan'an]

27:11.780 --> 27:14.080
Where did that guy in the wheelchair go?

27:26.530 --> 27:28.590
Why is there no scent of Hailou at all?

27:55.430 --> 27:56.650
The Nan'an,

27:58.220 --> 27:59.920
speed 12 knots.

28:01.050 --> 28:02.180
The Bowne,

28:03.740 --> 28:05.110
speed 6 knots.

28:08.140 --> 28:10.540
The speed gap between the two ships
is huge.

28:10.590 --> 28:11.940
Even if I hijack the Bowne,

28:11.940 --> 28:13.600
I wouldn't be able to catch up.

28:13.750 --> 28:15.280
You are hijacking the ship?

28:15.580 --> 28:16.520
Shut up.

28:22.740 --> 28:23.870
Who are you?

28:24.640 --> 28:25.940
I don't know you.

28:28.640 --> 28:29.240
Money.

28:29.880 --> 28:30.650
My money.

28:30.550 --> 28:36.580
[004]

28:33.190 --> 28:33.850
What?

28:35.010 --> 28:37.590
Are you going to seek justice
from the ship tyrant?

28:37.590 --> 28:39.450
Are you getting off the ship then?

28:39.810 --> 28:40.550
If you go and cause trouble,

28:40.550 --> 28:42.440
will they let you stay on this ship?

28:42.440 --> 28:43.270
Can you stay alive?

28:43.270 --> 28:44.310
Stop trying to get yourself killed,
alright?

28:44.310 --> 28:45.510
Life is so precious.

28:47.980 --> 28:49.310
Forget about the money.

28:49.770 --> 28:50.810
I just saw it.

28:50.830 --> 28:53.360
You still have quite a bit of money,
don't you?

28:53.680 --> 28:55.610
How could you go through my things?

28:56.550 --> 28:58.200
Compared to many on this ship,

28:58.200 --> 28:59.720
you are considered well-off.

28:59.720 --> 29:01.700
This ticket is a one-way trip to hell.

29:01.700 --> 29:03.430
The money you spent is worth it.

29:03.570 --> 29:04.710
Stop messing around.

29:04.710 --> 29:05.680
Hide this money.

29:16.890 --> 29:18.290
Let me ask you something.

29:18.550 --> 29:19.950
Where is this ship going?

29:20.770 --> 29:21.550
Jinfan.

29:22.030 --> 29:22.850
Jinfan?

29:23.980 --> 29:26.180
Can a small ship like this reach Jinfan?

29:26.540 --> 29:28.550
As far as I know, these unlicensed ships,

29:28.550 --> 29:29.480
once out at sea,

29:29.480 --> 29:31.140
will rob you blind.

29:32.010 --> 29:33.070
They sell the women

29:33.140 --> 29:34.440
and throw the men into the sea.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.740
That was in the past.

29:36.590 --> 29:39.330
Ever since the legend of the Sea Plague,

29:39.780 --> 29:41.840
such things haven't happened again.

29:42.590 --> 29:44.650
That's how my brother went to Jinfan.

29:45.790 --> 29:48.160
I'm going to Jinfan to find him.

29:51.150 --> 29:52.370
You know a lot about the Plague?

29:52.370 --> 29:53.570
Haven't you heard?

29:53.870 --> 29:56.030
The Sea Plague is very formidable.

29:56.480 --> 29:58.400
I heard he wears a mask

29:58.420 --> 29:59.680
and specifically kills those

29:59.680 --> 30:02.480
evil sailors
who rob and kill Chinese passengers.

30:02.510 --> 30:04.310
I heard he has a blade in his mouth

30:04.650 --> 30:06.700
to slice open the mouths
of those bad guys.

30:06.700 --> 30:09.430
Ever since the Plague
appeared in the South Seas,

30:09.510 --> 30:11.160
Chinese passengers on this route

30:11.160 --> 30:12.890
have been respected much more.

30:15.180 --> 30:15.850
Well said.

30:18.980 --> 30:19.980
You're bleeding!

30:20.710 --> 30:21.620
Keep it down.

30:23.770 --> 30:24.270
You...

30:31.040 --> 30:32.320
What's the fuss about bleeding?

30:32.320 --> 30:33.580
Why are you so nervous?

30:33.700 --> 30:34.630
I'm not nervous.

30:34.940 --> 30:35.440
You...

30:36.100 --> 30:37.140
You're a wanted criminal?

30:37.140 --> 30:37.970
What are you talking about?

30:37.970 --> 30:38.830
I'm a victim.

30:38.850 --> 30:39.480
You're a victim,

30:39.480 --> 30:40.860
so what are you afraid of?

30:40.860 --> 30:42.590
I'm being hunted by my enemies.

30:42.980 --> 30:44.110
My parents are dead.

30:44.270 --> 30:45.850
My sister is still in their hands.

30:45.850 --> 30:46.690
They are extremely powerful.

30:46.690 --> 30:48.220
Now they've hired the police to catch me.

30:48.220 --> 30:49.550
How can I not be nervous?

30:49.570 --> 30:50.690
I have to save my sister.

30:50.690 --> 30:51.890
Wh-Wh-Wh-

30:51.970 --> 30:56.540
[004]

30:52.090 --> 30:53.160
Stop it.
You don't need to worry about this.

30:53.160 --> 30:55.260
The situation is very complicated now.

30:55.260 --> 30:55.880
Look.

30:58.050 --> 30:59.940
I got this from my enemy.

31:01.200 --> 31:04.200
They want to sacrifice my sister's life
to this thing.

31:17.240 --> 31:18.170
Eight years old.

31:21.770 --> 31:22.530
She is 8.

31:23.270 --> 31:24.870
My sister is only 8 years old.

31:25.940 --> 31:27.540
And she has lost our parents.

31:28.740 --> 31:29.870
I am all she has left.

31:31.270 --> 31:32.310
Can you give me

31:32.590 --> 31:33.850
and my sister a way out?

31:48.310 --> 31:50.370
Take this to stop the bleeding first.

31:50.600 --> 31:51.140
What?

31:51.740 --> 31:52.480
Take it.

31:55.770 --> 31:58.500
Although I don't understand
what you are saying,

31:58.740 --> 32:01.270
I think you must be
in some kind of trouble

32:01.290 --> 32:02.220
and need help.

32:03.170 --> 32:04.340
Stop the bleeding first.

32:04.340 --> 32:05.400
Your life matters.

32:05.970 --> 32:06.570
By the way,

32:10.330 --> 32:12.230
I also have a bottle of painkillers here.

32:12.230 --> 32:13.160
Take some first.

32:13.370 --> 32:14.230
It should help.

32:19.900 --> 32:21.480
You actually bought that?

32:23.380 --> 32:24.990
I mean, all along my way,

32:25.020 --> 32:26.150
I've been all alone.

32:26.810 --> 32:28.670
No one has been willing to help me.

32:29.270 --> 32:30.270
You are the first.

32:31.040 --> 32:31.770
That's nice.

32:34.190 --> 32:35.190
I understand you.

32:35.360 --> 32:36.620
I have family too.

32:37.790 --> 32:39.590
They are waiting for me far away.

32:42.730 --> 32:44.960
Besides, I think you have a kind face.

32:45.800 --> 32:47.500
You don't really look like a murderer.

32:47.500 --> 32:48.150
Right?

32:48.970 --> 32:49.900
Moreover,

32:51.510 --> 32:52.980
if what you said is true,

32:53.510 --> 32:55.840
wouldn't I really be killing your sister?

32:57.590 --> 32:58.090
Cousin.

32:58.860 --> 33:00.920
I'd like to ask you for one more favor.

33:01.640 --> 33:02.440
What is it?

33:03.160 --> 33:04.590
With this injury,

33:04.620 --> 33:07.220
it's really hard for me
to get around right now.

33:07.380 --> 33:09.640
Could you help me ask the sailor

33:10.270 --> 33:12.000
for the Bowne's route?

33:12.490 --> 33:14.250
I need to plan how to save my sister.

33:14.250 --> 33:16.190
I have the Bowne's route.

33:18.630 --> 33:20.280
Look, the Bowne

33:20.300 --> 33:21.540
sets sail at dusk.

33:21.570 --> 33:23.370
It leaves from Balongzhou Pier,

33:23.370 --> 33:25.860
heads out into the open sea,
and goes straight to Jinfan.

33:25.860 --> 33:27.830
The Nan'an has already set sail.

33:27.900 --> 33:30.590
But it has to reach
Ningcheng Deep Water Port first,

33:30.590 --> 33:32.450
then head back into the inland sea

33:32.900 --> 33:33.750
to return to Xiacheng.

33:33.750 --> 33:34.790
The Nan'an?

33:36.380 --> 33:39.180
Are you talking about a luxury cruise ship

33:39.200 --> 33:41.090
that also departs from Balongzhou Pier?

33:41.090 --> 33:42.890
I think I saw it before I boarded.

33:43.130 --> 33:44.240
My sister is on the Nan'an.

33:44.240 --> 33:45.320
I have to go save her.

33:45.320 --> 33:47.400
Your sister is on the Nan'an?

33:47.780 --> 33:51.710
These two ships will both be at
the junction of the inland and open seas,

33:51.810 --> 33:53.540
sharing an overlapping route.

33:53.580 --> 33:55.900
That means these two ships

33:56.640 --> 33:57.900
will pass on this route

33:58.160 --> 33:59.090
at the same time.

33:59.500 --> 34:00.760
The speed of the Nan'an

34:01.600 --> 34:02.300
is 12 knots.

34:02.980 --> 34:05.580
But its route is much longer
than the Bowne's.

34:05.750 --> 34:08.750
The arrival time
should be around 6 or 7 in the evening.

34:09.870 --> 34:11.530
The Bowne's speed is 6 knots,

34:11.550 --> 34:13.870
so the time
it reaches the junction will be...

34:13.870 --> 34:15.580
4:28 PM today.

34:15.600 --> 34:17.170
The exact arrival time of the Nan'an

34:17.170 --> 34:18.340
will be 6:36 PM.

34:18.370 --> 34:19.770
Why are you drawing this?

34:21.550 --> 34:24.820
You are not thinking about jumping
into the sea and swimming there, are you?

34:24.820 --> 34:25.429
Cousin,

34:25.850 --> 34:27.460
you are so smart.

34:28.280 --> 34:29.409
So,

34:29.440 --> 34:31.100
I just need to reach

34:31.139 --> 34:32.739
the junction

34:32.770 --> 34:34.550
before 6:36 tonight,

34:35.130 --> 34:38.310
and I can get on the Nan'an
to save my sister.

34:38.520 --> 34:39.280
Wait.

34:39.330 --> 34:41.530
Who on earth did you offend?

34:42.150 --> 34:42.949
Gang members?

34:43.210 --> 34:44.179
Pirates?

34:45.590 --> 34:47.580
People on this ship like to gamble.

34:48.880 --> 34:49.500
Cousin,

34:50.600 --> 34:51.820
I need you to lend me some more money.

34:51.820 --> 34:52.540
I promise I'll pay you back.

34:52.540 --> 34:54.400
There's no way I'll lend you more.

34:58.590 --> 34:59.280
Pay up!

34:59.280 --> 35:00.400
-Pay up!
-Pay up!

35:01.010 --> 35:01.780
Hurry up!

35:18.440 --> 35:19.180
Oh no.

35:20.140 --> 35:21.030
My money!

35:33.710 --> 35:34.400
Eight of bamboos.

35:34.400 --> 35:36.590
I won! I won again!

35:36.720 --> 35:38.220
A flush.

35:39.170 --> 35:40.320
Give me the money.

35:40.360 --> 35:43.130
Salty, I really underestimated you.

35:43.130 --> 35:44.590
Look at your amazing luck.

35:45.010 --> 35:46.670
You're the lucky one, Dragon.

35:46.690 --> 35:47.350
Here.

35:47.980 --> 35:48.770
Take it.

35:48.980 --> 35:50.380
That's not appropriate.

35:50.460 --> 35:51.570
Take it, Dragon.

35:51.970 --> 35:52.820
My cousin

35:52.820 --> 35:53.910
is not very sensible.

35:53.910 --> 35:55.370
Please be understanding.

35:55.720 --> 35:56.630
From now on,

35:56.650 --> 35:58.850
your cousin's business is my business.

36:00.250 --> 36:01.450
Give me my money back!

36:01.460 --> 36:03.920
Look, speak of the devil.

36:07.180 --> 36:08.120
Turmeric?

36:09.170 --> 36:10.030
He's cheating.

36:10.220 --> 36:11.180
He's a scammer.

36:11.580 --> 36:13.250
His hands smell of turmeric.

36:13.270 --> 36:15.400
He rubbed turmeric
on the tiles to mark them.

36:15.400 --> 36:17.110
How could you do such a thing?

36:17.540 --> 36:19.790
Everyone here earns their money
through hard work.

36:19.790 --> 36:21.580
By doing this, they will die!

36:21.610 --> 36:24.130
Do you believe the Plague
will take you away?

36:24.630 --> 36:25.590
Great.

36:25.710 --> 36:27.170
You've been cheating?

36:27.930 --> 36:28.850
I didn't cheat.

36:29.230 --> 36:30.650
You're the ones cheating.

36:30.650 --> 36:32.160
You're the ones
who rubbed the turmeric on the tiles.

36:32.160 --> 36:34.350
I just got a little
on my hands from the tiles.

36:34.350 --> 36:35.480
Cousin, don't you have a good nose?

36:35.480 --> 36:36.360
Why don't you take a sniff?

36:36.360 --> 36:37.450
See if the smell on his hands

36:37.450 --> 36:38.710
is stronger than mine.

36:43.600 --> 36:44.780
Why did you hit me?

36:45.920 --> 36:48.180
These guys were scamming in Balai.

36:48.290 --> 36:49.190
They made enough money there,

36:49.190 --> 36:51.680
and now they're on this ship
to continue scamming in Jinfan.

36:51.680 --> 36:52.450
These scumbags.

36:52.450 --> 36:53.730
If you don't kick them off the ship,

36:53.730 --> 36:54.990
just wait for bad luck.

36:55.700 --> 36:57.390
You believe his nonsense?

36:58.350 --> 36:59.210
Take the money.

36:59.670 --> 37:01.450
I'm returning it to you with interest.

37:01.450 --> 37:03.000
We met scammers!

37:03.020 --> 37:05.580
Exactly. This brat lives in a compartment,

37:05.610 --> 37:07.130
while we live in a common room.

37:07.130 --> 37:08.570
At his age,

37:08.590 --> 37:10.600
where did he get the money
to live in a compartment?

37:10.600 --> 37:13.150
He must have scammed all that money.

37:13.920 --> 37:14.450
Okay.

37:14.520 --> 37:16.040
I won't meddle in this.

37:16.690 --> 37:17.560
Let's listen to Dragon.

37:17.560 --> 37:19.010
Dragon, be the judge here.

37:19.010 --> 37:19.590
Dragon.

37:19.610 --> 37:20.500
No, no.

37:20.710 --> 37:22.330
It's your grudge.

37:23.680 --> 37:25.080
You solve it yourselves.

37:25.090 --> 37:26.290
Solve it yourselves.

37:27.080 --> 37:27.880
Dragon...

37:28.510 --> 37:29.650
So disloyal?

37:30.010 --> 37:31.710
Let the Sea Plague take you!

37:31.740 --> 37:33.790
That's right! Take the money!

37:33.810 --> 37:35.070
Throw him into the sea!

37:35.300 --> 37:36.480
There's the Plague in the sea!

37:36.480 --> 37:38.170
The Plague has a blade in his mouth!

37:38.170 --> 37:40.500
Let the Plague cut off his stinking mouth!

38:13.620 --> 38:15.160
Hello, everyone.

38:15.690 --> 38:17.550
Didn't you want to see the Plague?

38:18.340 --> 38:20.580
The Plague is here!

38:23.220 --> 38:24.600
He is the Sea Plague?

38:25.560 --> 38:26.700
Really?

38:29.320 --> 38:31.780
The Plague! The Sea Plague!

38:31.810 --> 38:36.360
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

38:36.390 --> 38:41.090
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

38:41.110 --> 38:46.500
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

38:46.530 --> 38:52.440
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

38:52.530 --> 38:56.170
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

38:56.200 --> 39:02.150
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

39:02.170 --> 39:08.590
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

39:08.610 --> 39:09.700
How could it be?

39:09.720 --> 39:11.860
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!

39:11.890 --> 39:13.510
The hero I admire,

39:14.280 --> 39:15.660
the Sea Plague,

39:17.490 --> 39:20.220
the knight
who protects the Chinese passengers,

39:21.060 --> 39:21.920
is actually...

39:23.700 --> 39:24.520
him.

39:24.550 --> 39:29.510
The Sea Plague! The Sea Plague!
